        //- Our Happiness
        .story-card.reverse
          //- .story-image
          //-   img(src='./img/logo3.jpg' alt='Our Services')
          .story-content
            span.section-label What We Offer
            h2.story-title Our Happiness is in Your Profit
            p.story-text
              | We work with multiple financers including <strong>Government banks, Private banks, and Private financers</strong> across various segments.
            .highlight-box
